statement error 42601 WITH CHECK cannot be applied to SELECT or DELETE
CREATE POLICY bad ON notes FOR SELECT WITH CHECK (true)

statement error 42704 policy "nope" for table "notes" does not exist
DROP POLICY nope ON notes

statement ok
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS nope ON notes

